90
00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.969
BFF per client; micro-frontends for the seller portal.

91
00:06:50.249 --> 00:06:50.932
Why:

92
00:06:51.212 --> 00:06:54.412
Different client needs; independent seller-portal teams.

93
00:06:54.692 --> 00:06:56.569
