L2, What a module boundary costs when it becomes a network boundary.

388
00:34:54.915 --> 00:34:55.854
Requirement:

389
00:34:56.134 --> 00:35:01.915
Should Pricing, Inventory and Promotions stay modules in our monolith or become services?

390
00:35:02.195 --> 00:35:03.390
Put numbers on it.

391
00:35:03.670 --> 00:35:14.571
The same five collaborator functions are called in-process, as five serial HTTP calls to five real HTTP services, and as five parallel calls.

392
00:35:14.851 --> 00:35:20.206
Responses are verified identical; 3,000 measured runs each after warm-up.

393
00:35:20.486 --> 00:35:24.689
Then the availability arithmetic for required synchronous dependencies.

